    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Queen of the Palibati protects the Seal of Shilen. According to Shilen's Priest Hisilrome, who is also a Palibati, Themis is a living piece of the Queen of Evil Spirits, Shilen. Themis is one of the monsters birthed by Shilen during the War of the Gods, and as a result her authority nearly equals that of the Death Lords. Capable of summoning and ruling over both dead and devils, she employs the low-Lv. devil, Succubus, as her maid. Beast Lv. 3 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Beasts. Critical Damage +7.5% Atk. Spd. +5% Speed +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sword +10% Resistance to Dual Sword +10% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resistance to Dagger -10% Resistance to Dual Dagger -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Dagger Lv. 7 Daggers Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
